# Wooden Header Navigation

Status: DONE
Milestone: M35 Continuous wooden signboard above the cloth canopy
Dependencies: 25_WOODEN_BACKLIT_SHOP_SIGN.todo; 32_CONTINUOUS_WOOD_AND_RAISED_SIGN.todo

## Purpose

The owner rejects the cream navigation strip between the wooden identity and
cloth canopy. The navigation should sit on the wooden board, with light lettering
like the descriptor and a raised wooden How to order button.

## Tasks

- [x] Preserve the current header template, styles and reviewer.
- [x] Place navigation inside the existing continuous wooden signboard.
- [x] Match the descriptor's cream lettering and shadow with readable 18px links.
- [x] Add a textured, bevelled wooden ordering button without changing its action.
- [x] Preserve responsive wrapping, 48px targets, visible focus and forced-colour/print modes.
- [x] Check all header widths at 100%/200% text and actual wooden-row pixels.
- [x] Refresh current launch artwork and documentation with the architectural facade release.
- [x] Publish only scoped generated changes and confirm the live site.

## Acceptance criteria

- No cream navigation band interrupts the wood between the name and canopy.
- Original wood, branding, Courgette/DM Sans and navigation destinations remain.
- Links match the descriptor's light treatment; How to order looks like a wood button.
- No text shrinking, hidden mobile navigation, clipped targets or low-contrast focus.
- Facade, interior, notebook, audio and cloth behavior are not accidentally changed.

